  description: "If your opponent controls 5 or more face-up cards, this card's activation
    and effect cannot be negated, also you can activate this card the turn it was
    Set. At any of the following timings: Negate the effects of as many face-up cards
    your opponent controls as possible, and if you do, destroy them, also your monsters
    cannot attack directly until the end of the next turn after this card resolves.\r\n\u25CF
    When the monster your opponent controls with the highest ATK (even if tied) declares
    an attack.\r\n\u25CF When your opponent activates a monster effect that would
    destroy a card(s) on the field.\r\n\u25CF When your opponent activates a monster
    effect in the hand or field during your turn."
